    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061128.0334\n\nDOHA, Nov. 28 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nStarting line-up of Qatar against Jordan at Asian Games\n\n\n\n\nFollowing is the starting line-up of hosts Qatar against Jordan at the second-round of football events at Doha Asian Games here on Tuesday:\n\nForwards: Abdulrahman Hussain Ya, Quintana Sebastian, Rajab Bilal Mohammed\n\nMidfielders: Mohd Adel Lamy, Al Hamad Mesaad Ali, Abdulmajid Wesam Rizik, Rahmati Younes Ali\n\nDefenders: Saleh Ali Nasser, Koni Abdulla Obaid, Siddiq Majdi Abdulla\n\nGoalkeeper: Ahmed Mohamed Saqr",
